  "scopeDecisions": [
    "Existing ことができる, なくてもいい, がほしい, とき and ないで are retained as basic N5 study based on JLPT Sensei and common beginner sequencing; Bunpro indexes some as N4. No extra N4 conjugations or uses are added.",
    "Object あげる・くれる・もらう are N5 on Bunpro; Vて benefactives remain N4.",
    "Standalone でも is a sentence connector; Nでも and 誰でも are excluded.",
    "お・ご teaches fixed noun prefixes only; full verb keigo remains outside this batch."
  ]
